%--
The book's home page: no numbered heading (it would take chapter 1's
number). The contents are references: the engine gives each entry its
number, title and link; "toc" is a reference form the page declares.
--%

#{ $.element('heading', {forms: {toc: [slot('supplement'), slot('number'), ' ', slot('title')]}}) }
#strong[测试书]

一本最小的测试书，只用来验收书籍栏目。

- #ref("preface", {form: "title"})
- #ref("ch-a", {form: "toc"})
- #ref("ch-b", {form: "toc"})
- #ref("ch-c", {form: "toc"})
